cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "Robust Ensemble Forecasting in Practice: Model Selection and Combination Across Heterogeneous Time Series"
message: "If you use this dataset or code, please cite the paper."
type: software
abstract: >-
  Data, out-of-fold forecasts and analysis code for "Robust Ensemble Forecasting
  in Practice". 99 daily commercial series from 65 organisations, screened from a
  public marketing-mix dataset, are evaluated at three rolling origins (293 cells)
  for five base models, four combination rules and three selection strategies.
  The repository regenerates every table and figure in the paper from the
  deposited forecasts, and re-derives the corpus from the source dataset.
